 ## Retries
 
-A capture that times out is tried again, up to 3 attempts in all, one after the other.
+A capture that times out is tried again with growing pauses between attempts. The
+[capture loop](../../larder/capture.py) defines the attempt limit and delays.
+
+During the gateway's Friday peak, immediate retries all landed in the same slow period, leaving 58 confirmed
+pantry orders uncharged for a volunteer to capture by hand. A sandbox replay with spaced retries would have
+captured 57 of those orders. The longer wait was accepted to reduce manual captures: a member can spend up to
+20 seconds longer on the confirmation page.
 
